---
/**
 * @category Testimonials
 * @theme starquix
 * @name Testimonials3
 */
---
<section class='bg-stone-50 px-4 py-20 md:px-10 md:py-28 xl:px-16 xl:py-32 dark:bg-stone-900'>
  <div class='grid grid-cols-1 gap-12 md:grid-cols-12 md:gap-10 xl:gap-8'>
    <figure class='m-0 flex flex-col gap-8 md:col-span-10 md:gap-10 xl:col-span-7'>
      <blockquote class='m-0'>
        <p class='m-0 font-sans text-2xl leading-snug tracking-[-0.02em] text-stone-900 text-pretty md:indent-[-0.4em] md:text-3xl md:leading-snug xl:text-[2.5rem] xl:leading-[1.2] dark:text-stone-50'>„Pečeme 38 druhů pečiva a kvůli každé změně ceny jsme psali vývojáři. Teď si ceník v krámě upravujeme sami dva a ozveme se, jen když chceme něco nového.“</p>
      </blockquote>
      <figcaption class='flex items-center gap-4'>
        <img class='block h-14 w-14 shrink-0 rounded-full object-cover' src='/assets/userpics/userpic05.webp' alt='Portrét Elišky Kovářové' width='56' height='56' />
        <div class='flex flex-col gap-0.5'>
          <p class='m-0 font-sans text-base font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-50'>Elif Kaya</p>
          <p class='m-0 font-sans text-base text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400'>Spolumajitel, Keramika Hrádek</p>
        </div>
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
    <div class='flex flex-col gap-6 rounded-2xl bg-white p-6 shadow-[0_1px_2px_rgb(28_25_23/0.06),0_16px_40px_-16px_rgb(28_25_23/0.18)] ring-1 ring-stone-200 md:col-span-7 md:self-start xl:col-span-4 xl:col-start-9 dark:bg-stone-800 dark:ring-stone-700'>
      <div class='flex min-h-8 flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3'>
        <h3 class='m-0 font-sans text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-50'>Keramika za rohem</h3>
        <span class='rounded-full bg-sky-100 px-3 py-1 font-sans text-sm font-medium leading-none text-sky-800 dark:bg-sky-950 dark:text-sky-200'>Příběh ze sousedství</span>
      </div>
      <div class='flex flex-col'>
        <div class='flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 border-0 border-t border-solid border-stone-200 py-3 dark:border-stone-700'>
          <p class='m-0 font-sans text-base text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400'>Přišli z</p>
          <p class='m-0 text-right font-sans text-base text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-50'>Supermarket</p>
        </div>
        <div class='flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 border-0 border-t border-solid border-stone-200 py-3 dark:border-stone-700'>
          <p class='m-0 font-sans text-base text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400'>Web</p>
          <p class='m-0 text-right font-sans text-base text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-50'>38 druhů pečiva a sezonní deník</p>
        </div>
        <div class='flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 border-0 border-t border-solid border-stone-200 py-3 dark:border-stone-700'>
          <p class='m-0 font-sans text-base text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400'>Upravili</p>
          <p class='m-0 text-right font-sans text-base text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-50'>Dva lidé v krámě</p>
        </div>
        <div class='flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 border-0 border-t border-solid border-stone-200 py-3 dark:border-stone-700'>
          <p class='m-0 font-sans text-base text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400'>Zvládli za</p>
          <p class='m-0 text-right font-sans text-base text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-50'>Tři týdny</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <a href='#' class='inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-stone-200 px-6 font-sans text-base font-semibold text-stone-900 no-underline transition-colors duration-150 ease-out hover:bg-stone-300 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-stone-900 dark:bg-stone-700 dark:text-stone-50 dark:hover:bg-stone-600 dark:focus-visible:outline-stone-50'>Přečíst příběh</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
